# Project

This is a small Python demo repo, not a production service.

- Keep changes small and local to the sample being edited.
- Do not introduce third-party dependencies unless the user explicitly asks.
- After code changes, run `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v`.
- Point to canonical files instead of restating their contents: `beamsearch/search.py`, `tests/test_search.py`.
- When adding a sample, follow `AGENTS.md` and update `README.md`.
